# Spotivibe environment values — server-side only.
#
# All values are OPTIONAL (milestone M3). Search works with none of them set:
# the baseline discovery path is keyless (no YouTube Data API key exists or
# is accepted). When adding a value:
#   1. add it to `src/server/env.ts` (serverEnvSchema),
#   2. document it here with a placeholder value,
#   3. read it only through `src/server/env.ts` — never from client code.
#
# Optional provider instance overrides (comma-separated base URLs; when
# unset, the built-in default lists in the provider modules are used):
#
# SPOTIVIBE_INVIDIOUS_INSTANCES=https://yewtu.be,https://invidious.f5.si
# SPOTIVIBE_PIPED_INSTANCES=https://pipedapi.ducks.party,https://api.piped.private.coffee
#
# Rules:
# - Secrets and provider keys are SERVER-ONLY: never prefix them with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# - Any NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable must be declared safe in `src/server/env.ts`
#   (clientEnvSchema) before use; undeclared ones fail server startup.
# - Never commit real values: `.env*` is git-ignored except this example file.
